  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Presidential Election &amp; Media Monitoring &#x2013; Sierra Leone Votes!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In collaboration with Open Society Initiative West Africa (OSIWA), Catholic Agency for Overseas Development (CAFOD) is supporting local partners to implement a citizen engagement initiative involving all stakeholders across Sierra Leone and the diaspora. The initiative is intended to strengthen capacity particularly of young persons to create alternative effective platforms for information collection and dissemination and promote access to information for citizens to meaningfully participate in local electoral processes to ensure a transparent, inclusive, responsive and accountable leadership after the March 7, 2018 elections.</narrative>
  </description>
